/ La section « Récolte » de la fiche plante (epic #348, phase 7) : une grille
  parties × douze mois, lisible d'un coup d'œil au verger. Tant que la plante
  n'a pas de fenêtre propre, elle montre celles de son espèce et propose de les
  personnaliser (copie, puis édition). Hors du formulaire du dossier, remplacée
  seule en Turbo Stream (`PlantHarvestsController`).

  L'éditeur rend les sept parties ; celles qui n'ont pas de fenêtre sont des
  `fieldset` cachés ET désactivés (rien n'est envoyé). Le contrôleur Stimulus
  `plant-harvest` en révèle une (« Ajouter une partie ») ou en retire une.
- editing = local_assigns[:editing]
- errors = local_assigns[:errors] || []
- draft = local_assigns[:draft]
- species = plant.plant_species
- inherited = plant.harvest_windows_inherited?
- own = plant.harvest_windows.to_a
- windows = plant.harvest_windows_effective
- rows = draft || own
- current_month = Date.current.month
- columns = "grid-template-columns: 4.25rem repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr))"
- prefix = dom_id(plant, :harvest_form)
section[id=dom_id(plant, :harvest) class="mt-6" data-plant-section="harvest" data-harvest-inherited=(inherited ? "true" : nil)]
  .mb-2.flex.items-baseline.justify-between.gap-3
    p class="text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-400" Récolte
    - if inherited
      p.truncate.text-xs.text-stone-400 = "Calendrier de l'espèce #{species.name}"

  - if windows.any?
    div[role="table" aria-label="Calendrier de récolte" class="grid items-center gap-x-0.5 gap-y-1" style=columns]
      div role="row" class="contents"
        span role="columnheader"
          span.sr-only Partie
        - MapTask::MONTHS.each do |month|
          - now = month == current_month
          span[role="columnheader"
               class="flex h-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[0.6rem] font-semibold #{now ? 'bg-forest text-white' : 'text-stone-400'}"
               title=MapTask.month_name(month)
               data-current-month=(now ? "true" : nil)]
            = MapTask.month_initial(month)
      - windows.each do |window|
        div role="row" class="contents" data-harvest-part=window.part aria-label="#{window.part_label} : #{window.months.map { |m| MapTask.month_name(m) }.join(', ')}"
          span.flex.min-w-0.items-center.gap-1.5 role="rowheader"
            span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full #{harvest_part_color(window.part)}" aria-hidden="true"
            span.truncate.text-xs.font-medium.text-stone-700 = window.part_label
          - MapTask::MONTHS.each do |month|
            - on = window.includes_month?(month)
            span[role="cell"
                 class="h-6 rounded #{on ? harvest_part_color(window.part) : (month == current_month ? 'bg-forest-tint' : 'bg-stone-100')}"
                 title="#{window.part_label} — #{MapTask.month_name(month)}"
                 data-month=month
                 data-active=(on ? "true" : nil)]
  - elsif !editing
    p.text-sm.text-stone-500 Aucun calendrier de récolte.

  - if inherited
    = button_to customize_plant_harvest_path(plant), method: :post,
                form: { class: "mt-3" },
                class: "flex h-11 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 text-sm font-medium text-forest hover:bg-forest-tint"
      | Personnaliser pour cette plante
  - else
    details.group.mt-3.rounded-lg.border.border-dashed.border-stone-300 open=(editing || nil)
      summary.flex.cursor-pointer.list-none.items-center.justify-between.px-3.py-2.text-sm.font-medium.text-forest
        span = rows.any? ? "Modifier le calendrier" : "+ Ajouter une partie"
        svg.h-4.w-4.text-stone-400.transition-transform.group-open:rotate-180 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
          polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"
      .border-t.border-stone-100.px-3.py-3
        = form_with url: plant_harvest_path(plant), method: :patch, id: prefix,
                    class: "space-y-3", data: { controller: "plant-harvest" } do
          - if errors.any?
            .rounded-lg.border.border-red-200.bg-red-50.px-3.py-2.text-xs.text-red-800 role="alert"
              - errors.each do |message|
                p = message
          p.text-xs.text-stone-500[data-plant-harvest-target="empty" hidden=(rows.any? || nil)]
            | Aucune partie : choisissez ce qui se récolte sur cette plante.
          - PlantHarvestWindow::PARTS.each do |part, label|
            - window = rows.find { |w| w.part == part }
            - months = window ? Array(window.months).compact_blank.map(&:to_i) : []
            fieldset[class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 p-2"
                     data-plant-harvest-target="row" data-part=part
                     hidden=(window ? nil : true) disabled=(window ? nil : true)]
              legend.sr-only = label
              .flex.items-center.justify-between.gap-2
                span.flex.items-center.gap-2.text-sm.font-medium.text-stone-800
                  span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full #{harvest_part_color(part)}" aria-hidden="true"
                  = label
                button[type="button" class="rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-stone-500 hover:bg-red-50 hover:text-red-600"
                       data-action="plant-harvest#remove" data-part=part aria-label="Retirer la partie #{label}"]
                  | Retirer
              / La valeur vide part toujours : une partie sans mois est refusée
                (lisiblement) plutôt que supprimée en silence.
              = hidden_field_tag "harvest[parts][#{part}][]", "", id: nil
              .mt-2.grid.grid-cols-6.gap-1
                - MapTask::MONTHS.each do |month|
                  label.cursor-pointer title=MapTask.month_name(month)
                    = check_box_tag "harvest[parts][#{part}][]", month, months.include?(month),
                                    id: "#{prefix}_#{part}_#{month}", class: "peer sr-only"
                    span class="flex h-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-stone-200 text-xs text-stone-600 transition-colors peer-checked:border-forest peer-checked:bg-forest peer-checked:text-white peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-forest"
                      = MapTask.month_abbr(month)
          div data-plant-harvest-target="adder"
            label.sr-only for="#{prefix}_add" Ajouter une partie
            select[id="#{prefix}_add" data-plant-harvest-target="picker" data-action="change->plant-harvest#add"
                   class="h-11 w-full rounded-lg border-stone-300 text-sm text-stone-600 shadow-sm focus:border-forest focus:ring-forest"]
              option value="" + Ajouter une partie…
              - PlantHarvestWindow::PARTS.each do |part, label|
                option value=part disabled=(rows.any? { |w| w.part == part } || nil) = label
          button type="submit" class="h-11 w-full rounded-lg bg-forest text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-forest-soft"
            | Enregistrer le calendrier
        - if own.any?
          = button_to plant_harvest_path(plant), method: :delete,
                      form: { class: "mt-2", data: { turbo_confirm: species&.harvest_windows&.any? ? "Oublier le calendrier propre à cette plante et reprendre celui de l'espèce #{species.name} ?" : "Effacer le calendrier de récolte de cette plante ?" } },
                      class: "h-11 w-full rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50"
            = species&.harvest_windows&.any? ? "Revenir au calendrier de l'espèce" : "Effacer le calendrier"
